## Title: |cff3abdf7Peavers|rUI
## Notes: The Peavers UI pack - an installer that sets up the whole suite in one pass
## Author: Peavers
## Version: 1.0.0

## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\PeaversCommons\src\Media\Icon.tga
## Category-enUS: Peavers

## X-Website: https://peavers.io
## X-Source-Code: https://github.com/peavers-warcraft/PeaversUI

# PeaversCommons and PeaversConfig are hard dependencies: the installer is built
# out of Commons' widgets and hands off to Config's window when it finishes, so
# without them there is nothing to show.
#
# The six display modules are OptionalDeps rather than Dependencies on purpose.
# A hard dependency would mean the pack refuses to load the moment somebody
# disables one of them - and the installer's whole second step is a list of
# modules you are allowed to turn off. OptionalDeps still guarantees load order,
# so every module has registered itself before the wizard reads the roster, and
# anything missing is reported on the welcome screen with a link rather than
# taking the pack down with it.
## Dependencies: PeaversCommons, PeaversConfig
## OptionalDeps: PeaversUnitFrames, PeaversMiniMap, PeaversChat, PeaversToolTip, PeaversSystemBars, PeaversPerformance

